        "text_i3qdf3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Vicky enjoys the balance of creativity and precision required in pre-press, where she taps into both the analytical and creative sides of her brain. She finds satisfaction in helping entrepreneurs bring their vision to life and loves the diversity the work offers.</p><p>Outside of work, Vicky is passionate about photography. She describes her approach to capturing the world through a camera as “shooting photos through grief-colored glasses,” a conscious effort to see the beauty in the world despite the hardships she’s faced. Vicky is a proud grandmother of three, a great-grandmother of one, and soon-to-be great-grandmother to another.</p>",
